physicalRef: claim/database
description: "Insurance-claims Link Analysis showcase - One row per insurance claim: policy, accident, loss and report dates, claim amount and the garage, clinic and lawyer on it (blank when none), plus the lawyer who referred the clinic. Landed by the claim Pipeline. Synthetic."
